### EURid EPP tests (pytest) ###
Split off from eurid-robot-project.

python3 -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

Create .env with: ENV_NAME, EPP_HOST, EPP_PORT, EPP_USER, EPP_PWD (base64, see ./encode_password.sh), REGISTRAR_CONTACT

### Run ###
pytest                              # all EPP tests
pytest -m smoke                     # smoke tests only
pytest -m "not no_ipv6_available_in_office"
ENV_FILE=.env.prod pytest -m smoke  # other env file
